cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(26,46,9)\">Ezek 46:9</ref> <bdbheb>קרית</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <highlight>city of our solemnities</highlight> (sacred seasons) <ref ref=\"Isa 33:20\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(23,33,20)\">Isa 33:20</ref> <bdbheb>טובים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>למ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 8:19\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(38,8,19)\">Zech 8:19</ref> || <bdbheb>שׁבתות</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 44:24\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(26,44,24)\">Ezek 44:24</ref> || <bdbheb>חדשׁים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 1:14\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,14)\">Isa 1:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 23:31\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(13,23,31)\">1Chr 23:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 8:13\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(14,8,13)\">2Chr 8:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 31:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,31,3)\">2Chr 31:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 10:34\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,34)\">Neh 10:34</ref> || <bdbheb>חנים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 46:11\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(26,46,11)\">Ezek 46:11</ref> <bdbheb>חגים חדשׁים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 45:17\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(26,45,17)\">Ezek 45:17</ref> || <bdbheb>ראשׁי חָדְשֵׁכֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 10:10\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,10)\">Num 10:10</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). — </p></div><div class=\"section\"><p></div><div class=\"remarks\"><b>Notes.</b> It is most probable that in <ref ref=\"Gen 1:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,14)\">Gen 1:14</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), where <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> || <bdbheb>אֹתֹת</bdbheb>, the reference is to the sacred seasons as fixed by moon's appearance; and so also <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עשׂה ירח למ</bdbheb> <highlight>he made the moon for sacred seasons</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 104:19\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"104\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"104\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(19,104,19)\">Ps 104:19</ref>, although many Lexicons &amp; Commentaries refer these to the <highlight>seasons</highlight> of the year. — <bdbheb>למועד</bdbheb> <bdbheb>מועדים וחצי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Dan 12:7\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(27,12,7)\">Dan 12:7</ref> <highlight>for a set time, times, and a half</highlight> = 3 1/2 appointed times = half the prophetic week of years, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Br')\">Br<sup>MP 453 f.</sup></lookup> — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ויאכלו את המ</bdbheb> they ate throughout the <highlight>sacred season</highlight> (of <transliteration>Maƒƒoth</transliteration>) <ref ref=\"2Chr 30:22\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(14,30,22)\">2Chr 30:22</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('AV')\"><reflink>AV</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('RV')\"><reflink>RV</reflink></lookup>, but <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Thes')\">Thes</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('SS')\">SS</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Be')\">Be</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ke')\">Ke</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Öt')\">Öttli</lookup> they ate <highlight>the offerings of the sacred season</highlight>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>וַיְכַלּוּ</bdbheb>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>appointed meeting:</highlight> <bdbheb>לְכָלחַֿי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בֵּית מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 30:23\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(18,30,23)\">Job 30:23</ref> <highlight>house of meeting for every living</highlight> (of She'ol); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>קְרִאֵי מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 16:2\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(4,16,2)\">Num 16:2</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) <highlight>called to the assembly</highlight> = <bdbheb>קְרִאֵי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>הָעֵדָה</bdbheb>; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>קרא עלי מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 1:15\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(25,1,15)\">Lam 1:15</ref> <highlight>called a festal meeting against me</highlight>; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בקרב מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 74:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"74\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"74\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,74,4)\">Ps 74:4</ref> <highlight>in the midst of thine assembly</highlight>; <bdbheb>הַר מוֺעֵד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 14:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,14,13)\">Isa 14:13</ref> <highlight>mount of meeting</highlight> or <highlight>assembly</highlight> (of the gods; the mountain of the gods in the extreme north, the oriental Olympus, Persian <transliteration><highlight>Alborg</highlight></transliteration>, Hindu <highlight>Meru</highlight>, Babylon. <highlight>Aralli</highlight>, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Len')\">Len<sup>Origines ii, ch. ix</sup></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>appointed place:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> the temple, || <bdbheb>שׂכּוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 2:6\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(25,2,6)\">Lam 2:6</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נוּגֵי ממ</bdbheb> <highlight>afflicted</highlight> (and driven) <highlight>from the place of assembly</highlight> <ref ref=\"Zeph 3:18\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(36,3,18)\">Zeph 3:18</ref> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Br')\">Br<sup>MP 225</sup></lookup>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> synagogues, <bdbheb>כָּלמֿוֺעֲדֵיאֵֿל בָּאָרֶץ</bdbheb> <highlight>all</highlight> <highlight>the appointed places of El in the land</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 74:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"74\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"74\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,74,8)\">Ps 74:8</ref> = <bdbheb>בֵּית וַעַד</bdbheb> <highlight>Sota</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 9:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,9,15)\">Ps 9:15</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>appointed sign, signal</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Judg 20:38\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,38)\">Judg 20:38</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> <bdbheb>אֹהֶל מוֺעֵד</bdbheb> <highlight>tent of meeting</highlight> (of God with his people: see  <bdbheb><reflink>יָעַד</reflink></bdbheb> Niph`al <b>1</b>); <highlightword>the sacred tent of the Exodus</highlightword> (see  <bdbheb><reflink>אֹהֶל</reflink></bdbheb> <b>3</b>) <ref ref=\"Exod 33:7\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(2,33,7)\">Exod 33:7</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Num 12:4\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(4,12,4)\">Num 12:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 31:14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,31,14)\">Deut 31:14</ref> (twice in verse) (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Num 11:16\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,16)\">Num 11:16</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>); often in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>, as <ref ref=\"Exod 27:21\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(2,27,21)\">Exod 27:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 29:4\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,4)\">Exod 29:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 1:1\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(3,1,1)\">Lev 1:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 1:3\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(3,1,3)\">Lev 1:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 18:1\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(6,18,1)\">Josh 18:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 19:51\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"51\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"51\" onclick=\"bcv(6,19,51)\">Josh 19:51</ref>, etc. (131 t.)&gt;; elsewhere only <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:22\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,22)\">1Sam 2:22</ref>b (omitted by <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup>), <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:4\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,4)\">1Kgs 8:4</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 5:5\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(14,5,5)\">2Chr 5:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 6:17\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(13,6,17)\">1Chr 6:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:21\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,21)\">1Chr 9:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 23:32\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(13,23,32)\">1Chr 23:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 2:3\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(13,2,3)\">1Chr 2:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 2:6\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(13,2,6)\">1Chr 2:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 2:13\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(13,2,13)\">1Chr 2:13</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Ps 102:14", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 102, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Exod 9:5", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 9, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Deut 31:10", "book": "DEU", "c